# Long jobs started with infynitae-bg (a build, a render, training): while the desktop wants the
# CPU or the disk they get a fifth of the share an app gets (weight 20 against the default
# 100), and above 60% of the RAM their memory is reclaimed first. With nothing else running they
# get the whole PC. Never a hard memory limit: a job is slowed, not killed.
[Unit]
Description=Infynitae: long jobs that yield to the desktop (infynitae-bg)

[Slice]
CPUWeight=20
IOWeight=20
MemoryHigh=60%
